## Legacy Log Files (Lumibot-generated, older runs only)

Lumibot still writes flat files to `logs/` as a side effect. These are **not** the authoritative source for current runs — use the DB instead. They remain useful only for runs that pre-date the DB integration.

### Naming Convention
```
logs/BobsBrain_<YYYY-MM-DD>_<HH-MM>_<6-char-id>_<type>.<ext>
```

Always prefer `.csv` over `.parquet` — parquet is binary and cannot be read directly.

### Files produced per run
- `_settings.json` — run config (superseded by `backtest_runs`)
- `_stats.csv` — portfolio timeline (superseded by `portfolio_snapshots`)
- `_trade_events.csv` — full order lifecycle including `new` events; filter to `status=fill` (superseded by `trades`)
- `_trades.csv` — duplicate of `_trade_events.csv`
- `_indicators.csv` — custom signals; currently empty
